{
  "$schema": "https://jw-control.github.io/jwplc-sim/schema/jwsim-1.json",
  "format": "jwsim",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Lección 50 · Consignas desde el celular",
  "board": {
    "id": "jwplcbasic",
    "package": {
      "minRef": "v2.1.0-alpha.19"
    }
  },
  "program": {
    "kind": "arduino",
    "sketch": "./sketch/Consignas_desde_el_celular/Consignas_desde_el_celular.ino"
  },
  "exercise": {
    "lesson": "curso-50",
    "rubric": "./rubrica.json",
    "solution": "./solucion/Consignas_desde_el_celular",
    "brief": {
      "goal": "Un «Contador a cero» en el panel: la variable bool «reiniciar», que el operador pone en verdadero, deja las cajas en 0 y el programa la devuelve a falso.",
      "steps": [
        "Ejecuta el ejemplo, entra al panel y cambia la «Meta del lote» a 3. Arranca con S1: al contar 3 cajas en B1, la banda para sola.",
        "Prueba una meta de 500: el panel la rechaza, porque range(1, 100) no la deja pasar.",
        "Publica bool reiniciar con el id «reiniciar» y writable(WEB_OPERADOR). Si vale verdadero: cajas a 0, reiniciar a falso y «Contador a cero desde el panel»."
      ],
      "uses": [
        "Ethernet · panel web en http://192.168.250.10/",
        "I0_0 · B1, sensor de cajas",
        "I0_1 · S1, lote nuevo (NA)",
        "I0_2 · S2, parada (NC)",
        "Q0_0 · KM1, banda"
      ],
      "teaches": "Con writable() y range() el panel cambia variables del programa sin riesgo: solo los roles permitidos y solo dentro del rango. Una orden de un toque se devuelve a falso al cumplirla."
    }
  },
  "simulation": {
    "seed": 1,
    "realtimeFactor": 1
  },
  "scene": {
    "devices": [
      {
        "id": "plc",
        "type": "jwsim/jwplc-basic",
        "x": 280,
        "y": 360
      },
      {
        "id": "PS1",
        "type": "jwsim/power-24vdc",
        "params": {
          "model": "MDR-60"
        },
        "x": 0,
        "y": 360
      },
      {
        "id": "S1",
        "type": "jwsim/pushbutton-no",
        "params": {
          "color": "verde",
          "label": "Marcha"
        },
        "x": 460,
        "y": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "S2",
        "type": "jwsim/pushbutton-nc",
        "params": {
          "color": "rojo",
          "label": "Parada"
        },
        "x": 660,
        "y": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "B1",
        "type": "jwsim/sensor-photoelectric",
        "x": 320,
        "y": 140
      },
      {
        "id": "KM1",
        "type": "jwsim/contactor",
        "x": 280,
        "y": 1060
      }
    ],
    "wiring": [
      {
        "from": "PS1.+V1",
        "to": "plc.24VDC"
      },
      {
        "from": "PS1.-V1",
        "to": "plc.M0"
      },
      {
        "from": "PS1.-V1",
        "to": "plc.M1"
      },
      {
        "from": "PS1.+V1",
        "to": "S1.13",
        "ref": true
      },
      {
        "from": "S1.14",
        "to": "plc.I0_1"
      },
      {
        "from": "PS1.+V1",
        "to": "S2.11",
        "ref": true
      },
      {
        "from": "S2.12",
        "to": "plc.I0_2"
      },
      {
        "from": "PS1.+V1",
        "to": "B1.BN",
        "ref": true
      },
      {
        "from": "B1.BU",
        "to": "PS1.-V1",
        "ref": true
      },
      {
        "from": "B1.BK",
        "to": "plc.I0_0"
      },
      {
        "from": "PS1.+V1",
        "to": "plc.Q0_0.1"
      },
      {
        "from": "plc.Q0_0.2",
        "to": "KM1.A1"
      },
      {
        "from": "KM1.A2",
        "to": "PS1.-V1",
        "ref": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
